{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20232","headline":"峡哀 八 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡景滑易堕，峡花怪非春。\n红光根潜涎，碧雨飞沃津。\n巴谷蛟螭心，巴乡魍魉亲。\n噉生不问贤，至死独养身。\n腥语信者谁，拗歌欢非真。\n仄田无异稼，毒水多狞鳞。\n异类不可友，峡哀哀难伸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}